Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: Zig
Upstream-Contact: https://ziglang.org/
Source: https://ziglang.org/download/
Comment:
 Repackaging of the official Zig release builds for PL/Zig: the component
 tarballs orig-amd64 and orig-arm64 are the unmodified upstream tarballs
 zig-x86_64-linux-<version>.tar.xz and zig-aarch64-linux-<version>.tar.xz.
 The binary package contains the unchanged, statically linked compiler
 binary and a pruned copy of lib/ (std, compiler_rt, compiler, c and the
 top-level files of lib/). See NOTICE for the components linked into the
 binary and how they were identified.

